---
title: Apple Crisp Macchiato
---

Mix @espresso{2%shots} with @./Café/Apple Crisp Syrup{2%tbsp}. Pour in @milk{3/4%cup}(steamed), and top with @?cinnamon sugar{} and @?caramel sauce{} as desired.

> For an iced macchiato, add ice to a cup and then mix in the cooled espresso, milk, and syrup. Add toppings as desired.